{"id":52,"title":"Alexandria Production Preservation Proof — V2 (Revised)","authors":"Brian K. Ward","institution":"Independent / Guardians of the DAG","fundingSource":"Self-funded / Independent","publicationDate":"2026-11-01","submittedAt":"2026-11-01T19:58:51.717Z","abstract":"Controlled Version 2 preservation test for The Alexandria Protocol, linked directly to original record AP-0051. This deliberately revised document contains a changed control phrase to test whether Alexandria preserves both original and revised files with distinct SHA-256 fingerprints and a traceable, non-destructive version history. Both documents contain synthetic test evidence, not independent research findings. This record is not yet anchored to Kaspa.","keywords":["Alexandria Protocol","preservation test","SHA-256","exact-byte retrieval","version history","production validation"],"category":"physics","status":"preprint","documentHash":"083bb17add43518291ad7c65f84e3005883289410aca9d2d5e4ceda54c42484b","fileHash":"a286f3ffe06f7c9699d9dac4d4bab47f677000d50c80de6f7a036f08c392161c","fileName":"Alexandria_Production_Demo_V2_Revised.pdf","fileMimeType":"application/pdf","fileSize":27725,"fileDownloadUrl":"/api/studies/52/file","manifestHash":"6e4b69c745a8cb58f15c8a55bf41f0fe58826340df57f84d02b8dd6273287e5e","lineageId":"0ca03640-771d-41cb-9fa6-5d9dca8316a1","verificationStatus":"Hash verified","version":2,"previousVersionId":51,"relatedCount":0}